-- Derived tag (s57a), option A of DATAMODEL.md's tag-three-ways: nord is a stored bool column and `Nord` folds to it. One program runs against two registries — a stores the tag, b derives it from race — with identical pins, because both spell one denotation: the mask. Downstream nothing can tell them apart; the representation-independence claim as a running test.
--! registry ../registries/s57-derived-tag-a.reg
--! expect gold = 900 600 700 650 221
--! expect master = 2 -1 -1 4 -1

Nord & Gold > 50 , Gold += 500
